---
description: Keep source files small and split by responsibility
alwaysApply: true
---

# Max 200 Lines Per File

- Never create or leave source files above 200 lines.
- If a file grows close to 200 lines, split it immediately.
- Prefer splitting by responsibility:
  - UI widgets/layout
  - state/actions
  - API/data mapping
  - helpers/models/constants
- When splitting Dart/Flutter pages, use multiple files in the same feature folder (including `part` files or dedicated widget/helper files).
- Keep behavior unchanged during splits; refactor structure, not functionality.
- After any split, run analysis/tests and fix imports/references.

